WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,010
It's the tenth day

2
00:00:03,010 --> 00:00:04,610
All rescue announcements stopped

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:07,210
Le Feng's zombies started breaking into the house looking for people to eat.

4
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:09,010
This guy is a food blogger

5
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:11,410
Advertisers give away mountains of food

6
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,610
Just unlucky

7
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:13,810
Live in the wrong building

8
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:19,970
you are too heavy

9
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:22,770
You can't just drop the food first and then I can pull you up.

10
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:24,970
Come with anything

11
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,690
He was shocked

12
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,090
Things are dropped first

13
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:29,890
Why should they save him?

14
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:34,840
These days, one mouthful is not enough for one life.

15
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,240
I haven't eaten in a few days
